## Goal
An Android app providing fast, offline access to legal documents and practice materials. Supports **constitutions (ustav)**, **laws (zakoni)**, **bylaws (podzakonski akti)**, **court practice (sudska praksa)**, and **legal/administrative practice (pravna praksa)** across multiple languages and jurisdictions. Lawyers can search, navigate, bookmark, annotate, organize, track, and cross-reference content.

---

