## Core Features

### 1) Home
- Filter chips: Constitution • Laws • Bylaws • **Court practice** • **Legal practice**
- Global search bar (FTS)
- Cards: title • type badge • citation/meta • effective date • starred
- Quick actions: Open • Search-in-doc • Star • Share

### 2) Document & Practice Reader
- Header: title, type badge, citation/meta chips (effective/repealed for acts; court/date/outcome for cases; authority/date for practice notes)
- Outline drawer: Chapters/Sections (level 1) → Articles (level 2) for normative texts; Sections or Body for cases/practice notes
- **Unit reader** (one `Unit` per screen):
  - Render paragraphs (stavovi), points (tačke), bullets (alineje) from plain text
  - **Smart hyperlinks**: detect references like `čl. 12` and clickable citations to other documents/cases; show tooltip if target missing
  - **Inline definitions**: underline defined terms → bottom sheet with definition + jump link
  - **Highlight search terms** in context
- Tabs shown when relevant:
  - **Read | Definitions | Tariffs | Notes | Meta (cases/practice)**
  - **Citations** (citator): shows **cited by / cites** edges across laws, cases, practice notes

### 3) Search
- Global FTS across units (+ title)
- Highlighted snippets
- Filters (facets):
  - Type (Constitution/Law/Bylaw/Case/Practice)
  - Document(s)
  - Unit number range (for statutes)
  - **For cases**: court, year, outcome
  - **For practice**: issuing authority (ministry/agency/bar), year, topic tags
- Query helpers: `type:case`, `type:practice`, `doc:"Zakon o ..."`, `num:12`, `court:"Vrhovni sud"`, `year:2023`

### 4) User Features
- **Bookmarks** with **folders and tags**; optional note per bookmark
- **Notes** per unit (plain text)
- **History** of visited units
- **Starred documents** (pin to home)
- **Collections** (saved sets of anchors or saved searches)
- **Saved searches & alerts**: persist queries with filters; optional local notification when new data matches (triggered on data update)
- **Export/Import** user data as JSON (bookmarks, notes, collections, saved searches)

### 5) Lawyer Tools (not legal advice; productivity features)
- **Citator**: bidirectional citation graph (law ↔ case ↔ practice)
- **Deadline calculator** (configurable offsets, court/administrative rules; simple rules engine)
- **Docket/Case tracker** (manual entries): track case name/number, court, party, events, reminders
- **Template & checklist library** (plain text/Markdown): clauses, motions, standard filings; checklist items linked to anchors
- **Cross-doc links**: show related bylaws implementing a law; show cases interpreting a specific article

### 6) Accessibility & UX
- Adjustable font size & line spacing
- TalkBack labels (announce “Član 12, Zakon X”)
- RTL support, multiple languages
- High contrast themes

