## Data Model

> Keep the DB lean. Store **plain text** for units and derive formatting at render time. Use FTS mirror for search. Make it **jurisdiction- and language-agnostic**.

### Core Entities
- **Document**
  - `id` (slug), `title`, `type` = { `CONSTITUTION`, `LAW`, `BYLAW`, `CASE`, `PRACTICE` }
  - `language` (BCP47, e.g. `sr-Latn`, `me`, `en`), `jurisdiction` (e.g., `ME`)
  - `citation` (Official Gazette/case citation/authority memo id)
  - `promulgatedOn`, `effectiveOn`, `repealedOn` (ISO dates; nullable)
- **Unit** (smallest addressable chunk)
  - `id`, `docId`, `level` (0 header / 1 chapter / 2 article or body), `label`, `number`, `title`, `anchor`, `text`
- **Definition** (optional)
  - `id`, `docId`, `term`, `text`, `unitAnchor`
- **Tariff** (optional)
  - `id`, `docId`, `key` (e.g., “Tarifni broj 4”), `title`, `amount`, `notes`
- **CaseMeta** (only when `type=CASE`)
  - `docId`, `court`, `caseNumber`, `decidedOn`, `ecli`, `parties`, `keywords`, `outcome`
- **PracticeMeta** (only when `type=PRACTICE`)
  - `docId`, `authority` (issuer; e.g., ministry, tax admin, bar), `refNumber` (file no.), `issuedOn`, `category` (guidance/interpretation/FAQ), `keywords`

### Cross-reference & Citator (optional but recommended)
- **CitationEdge** (directed edge)
  - `fromDocId`, `fromAnchor?`, `toDocId`, `toAnchor?`, `relation` (`cites`, `interprets`, `implements`, `overrules`, `follows`), `weight` (small int), `note?`
- **CrossRefHint** (lightweight local links extracted at render time; can be regenerated)
  - `docId`, `unitAnchor`, `refText` (e.g., “čl. 12”), `targetDocId?`, `targetAnchor?`

### User & Organization Entities
- **BookmarkFolder** (`id`, `name`, `createdAt`)
- **Bookmark** (`id`, `folderId`, `docId`, `unitAnchor`, `title?`, `note?`, `createdAt`)
- **BookmarkTag** (`bookmarkId`, `tag`) — or a `tagsCsv` column if you prefer minimalism
- **Note** (`id`, `docId`, `unitAnchor`, `title?`, `body`, `updatedAt`)
- **History** (`id`, `docId`, `unitAnchor`, `visitedAt`)
- **StarredDoc** (`docId` PK, `starredAt`)
- **Collection** (`id`, `name`, `createdAt`)
- **CollectionItem** (`collectionId`, `docId`, `unitAnchor`, `position`)
- **SavedSearch** (`id`, `query`, `filtersJson`, `createdAt`, `notify` bool)
- **SearchQuery** (`id`, `query`, `createdAt`)
- **Template** (`id`, `title`, `language`, `bodyMd`, `tagsCsv`, `createdAt`)
- **Checklist** (`id`, `title`, `docId?`, `unitAnchor?`, `itemsJson`, `createdAt`)
- **Docket** (`id`, `caseName`, `caseNumber`, `court`, `notes`, `createdAt`)
- **DocketEvent** (`id`, `docketId`, `title`, `date`, `note?`, `reminder?`)

### DB requirements
- **Room** with **FTS (units_fts)** for full-text search (diacritic-insensitive `unicode61 remove_diacritics=2`)
- Migrations enabled; export schema
- Reasonable indexes: `units(docId, anchor)`, `units(number)`, `definitions(term)`, `case_meta(court, decidedOn)`, `practice_meta(authority, issuedOn)`

### Repositories
- **DocumentsRepo**: list/get; star/unstar; list starred
- **UnitsRepo**: get by anchor/number; list for level; list labels
- **SearchRepo**: FTS with filters and facets
- **DefinitionsRepo**: list for doc
- **TariffsRepo**: list for doc; get by key
- **CaseMetaRepo**: get/upsert
- **PracticeMetaRepo**: get/upsert
- **CitatorRepo**: list edges from/to; add edges (batch); resolve links
- **BookmarksRepo**: folders, bookmarks, tags
- **CollectionsRepo**: CRUD collections + items
- **NotesRepo**: list/upsert/delete
- **HistoryRepo**: recent/clear
- **SavedSearchesRepo**: CRUD + enable/disable notifications
- **TemplatesRepo**: list/search templates
- **ChecklistsRepo**: CRUD
- **DocketsRepo**: CRUD docket + events

