## Rendering Rules (plain text → structure at display)
- **Paragraphs**: split on `\n\((\d+)\)\s`
- **Points**: lines starting `^\s*\d+\)`
- **Bullets**: lines starting `^\s*–\s`
- **Smart hyperlinks**:
  - Detect intra-doc refs: `\bčl\.?\s*(\d+)\b` (and localized variants); clickable → open `UnitsRepo.getByNumber()`
  - Detect titles of other acts/cases if present in DB; show preview + “Open”
- **Definitions**: underline terms (diacritic-insensitive), bottom sheet with text + “Open context”
- **Search highlighting**: background spans for query tokens

