## Screens (Fragments)
- **HomeFragment**: filters, search, starred docs, recent activity
- **DocumentFragment**: header, outline, unit reader, tabs (Read/Definitions/Tariffs/Notes/Meta/Citations)
- **PracticeFragment** (optional separate entry-point view): list practice notes by authority/year/topic; open like Document
- **SearchFragment**: search bar, facets, results with highlights
- **BookmarksFragment**: folders + bookmarks + tags, move/rename/delete
- **CollectionsFragment**: manage collections; add/remove anchors
- **NotesFragment**: list notes (group by doc); open anchor on tap
- **HistoryFragment**: recents
- **CitatorFragment**: for a given doc/unit, show **Cited By** and **Cites** lists (group by type)
- **TemplatesFragment**: list/search templates; open details
- **ChecklistsFragment**: view/run checklists; link items to anchors
- **DocketsFragment**: list dockets; open details (events timeline); add reminders
- **SettingsFragment**: language, text size, privacy, data update, export/import

